From bb1653bcd52e0283bfb92588c9ecda3ed9e6aec5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:11:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] pwm: histb: add PMOC PWM driver

Add a driver for the PWM outputs of the PMOC block on the HiSilicon
Hi3798cv200 STB SoC, as described by the hisilicon,hi3798cv200-pwm
binding. The converters they feed are described with the generic
pwm-regulator binding.

The number of outputs is SoC specific, so it is carried by the match
data and the register window has to cover all of them. The name
conventions follow those of pcie-histb.c.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
